{"ts":"2026-08-31T02:50:06.565Z","type":"finding","frontier":"readiness-planning-deferral-bounded-main","claim":"Independent verification passed with a rebuilt, negative-controlled audit: the verifier judged the in-witness oracle weak (one receipt re-evaluates the owner's own predicate; the other rebuilds after the drive against a two-variable stub) and built its own, comparing every admitted serve against a forced rebuild AT THE ADMISSION INSTANT — 649 admissions on the witness drive with 0 divergences, and 5482 admissions with 217 audited against a pristine second ControlPlaneReadinessService on the same live cache with 0 decision divergences (only clock telemetry differed). It negative-controlled its own instrumentation: a seeded divergence yields 7 detections and a blinded comparator yields 0 with the seed present, so the zero is sensitive. Adversarial class construction (in-place cache mutation inside the 250 ms floor, a post-publish answer flip with no source write, deletion of the owner's node row inside the floored window) produces the same stale routable answer on BASE as on the candidate, so the sealed floored-reuse class is not widened. Genuine evidence absence still denies (cold bootstrap, saturated generation, rotated floored generation, guard moved after publish, expired heartbeat and ready lease). Freshness pursuit byte-identical apart from the two edits. Headline reproduced independently: base 23/23 denied with the leader named planning_snapshot_refresh_pending and the write returning PARTITION_SERVICE_NOT_FOUND, candidate 0/23 denied with 3/3 routable in all 23, 576 builds and 3 completions all STALE on both sides. Red-on-base exactly 4 of 9, each a measured assertion rather than a missing method. Sealed neighbours 489/489, rig pinned at 1218/824, control-plane 7005/7006 (the one failure being the uncommitted-src registry guard), query 2831/0, rebalancer plus workflow 6947/0, every audit and ratchet clean. NEW SUBCLASS recorded, non-blocking: a buil